  "title": "Evotec receives milestone payment from Bristol Myers Squibb following ...",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced that it has received a US$ 5 m milestone payment from Bristol Myers Squibb, following the acceptance of an Investigational New Drug (“IND”) application by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (“FDA”) in their strategic protein degradation partnership. The drug candidate, a cereblon E3 ligase modulator (“CELMoD™”) was developed under the collaboration, and a Phase 1 clinical trial is expected to begin in 2026. Read full press release here.",
